`git diff --stat`: exactly the two files, +13/−11; the only dht_test hunk is the `replies` binding at :1201. No assertion, wire format, codec, `dht/decode-message`, or `jing/base64->bytes` change. `git status --short` shows only these two modified files (the two untracked `collab/` files are the review prompt/findings notes, not code).

